Q(14,6,2,"A bus driver needs a passenger endorsement. Which sections of the manual does that knowledge test cover?","Sections 2 and 4",["Sections 5 and 6 only", "Section 9 only", "Sections 12 and 13"],"The passenger endorsement test covers Section 2 (Driving Safely) and Section 4 (Transporting Passengers Safely).");
