Q(14,6,2,"What is the most hazardous material a bus may carry in total, when it is allowed at all?","No more than 500 pounds total, and no more than 100 pounds of any one class",["1,001 pounds", "Any amount with placards", "2,000 pounds if labeled"],"A bus may never carry more than 500 pounds total of allowed hazardous materials, and no more than 100 pounds of any one class.");
