Q(14,6,2,"What is the standee line on a bus?","A two-inch line on the floor that standing riders must stay behind",["A line where riders wait outside the bus", "The line painted at a bus stop", "The limit line at a railroad crossing"],"No rider may stand forward of the rear of the driver's seat. A two-inch line on the floor, the standee line, shows where riders cannot stand.");
