Q(14,6,2,"How far before a railroad crossing must a bus stop?","Between 15 and 50 feet",["Between 5 and 10 feet", "At least 100 feet", "Exactly 75 feet"],"Stop your bus between 15 and 50 feet before railroad crossings. Look and listen in both directions.");
F(14,6,"How far before a railroad crossing must a bus stop?","Between 15 and 50 feet. Stop your bus between 15 and 50 feet before railroad crossings. Look and listen in both directions.");
Q(14,6,2,"At a drawbridge with no signal light or attendant, where must a bus stop?","At least 50 feet before the draw of the bridge",["On the draw itself", "15 feet past the bridge", "No stop is needed"],"Stop at least 50 feet before the draw of the bridge and make sure the draw is completely closed before crossing.");
