Q(14,6,2,"Your bus leans toward the outside on a banked curve. What does that tell you?","You are driving too fast",["Your tires are overinflated", "The road is banked the wrong way", "Your load is too light"],"If your bus leans toward the outside on a banked curve, you are driving too fast.");
