Q(14,6,2,"When may you fuel a bus with riders on board?","Only when absolutely necessary, and never in a closed building",["Any time", "Only at night", "Only if riders stay seated"],"Avoid fueling your bus with riders on board unless absolutely necessary. Never refuel in a closed building with riders on board.");
F(14,6,"When may you fuel a bus with riders on board?","Only when absolutely necessary, and never in a closed building. Avoid fueling your bus with riders on board unless absolutely necessary. Never refuel in a closed building with riders on board.");
Q(14,6,2,"What does a brake-door interlock do on a transit bus?","Applies the brakes and holds the throttle at idle when the rear door is open",["Locks the front door while driving", "Replaces the parking brake", "Sounds the horn when a door opens"],"The interlock applies the brakes and holds the throttle in idle when the rear door is open. Do not use it in place of the parking brake.");
