Q(14,6,2,"When should you NOT tow or push a disabled bus with riders aboard?","Unless getting off would be unsafe, never do it",["It is always allowed", "Only on highways", "Only in daylight"],"Do not tow or push a disabled bus with riders aboard unless getting off would be unsafe, and then only to the nearest safe spot.");
