Q(14,7,2,"Properly adjusted outside flat mirrors on a school bus let you see how far behind?","200 feet or 4 bus lengths",["50 feet or 1 bus length", "500 feet", "1 mile"],"Adjust the mirrors so you can see 200 feet or 4 bus lengths behind the bus, along the sides, and the rear tires touching the ground.");
