Q(14,7,2,"Where should you stop the school bus in relation to waiting students?","With the front bumper at least 10 feet away from them",["Right beside them", "With the door in front of the first student", "Past them by one bus length"],"Stop with the front bumper at least 10 feet away from students. That makes them walk to the bus, so you can see them better.");
