Q(14,7,2,"What does the manual say about backing a school bus?","It is strongly discouraged; back only when there is no other safe way",["It is the preferred way to leave a stop", "It is required at every stop", "It is allowed only with students outside behind the bus"],"Backing a school bus is strongly discouraged. Back only when you have no other safe way to move the vehicle.");
