Q(14,8,2,"What is a converter dolly?","A coupling device of one or two axles and a fifth wheel that couples a semitrailer to the rear of a tractor-trailer",["A spare tire carrier", "A device for lifting landing gear", "A type of tank baffle"],"A converter gear or dolly has one or two axles and a fifth wheel, and lets a semitrailer be coupled to the rear of a tractor-trailer combination.");
