Q(14,8,2,"Before backing the dolly under the rear trailer, how should the trailer height be?","Slightly lower than the center of the fifth wheel",["Much higher than the fifth wheel", "Exactly level with the frame", "It does not matter"],"Trailer height must be slightly lower than the center of the fifth wheel, so the trailer is raised slightly when the dolly is pushed under.");
