Q(14,8,2,"How do you check that air reaches the back of a set of doubles?","Open the emergency line shut-off at the rear of the last trailer and listen for air",["Look at the dash gauge only", "Kick the rear tires", "Pump the brake pedal ten times"],"Open the emergency line shut-off valve at the rear of the last trailer. You should hear air escaping, showing the entire system is charged.");
