Q(14,8,2,"Why should you never unlock the pintle hook with the dolly still under the rear trailer?","The dolly tow bar may fly up and cause injury",["The trailer lights will fail", "The air tanks will overfill", "The fifth wheel will lock"],"Never unlock the pintle hook with the dolly still under the rear trailer. The dolly tow bar may fly up, possibly causing injury.");
