Q(14,10,2,"Where may the driver keep hazardous materials shipping papers while driving?","In a pouch on the driver's door, or in clear view within reach with the seat belt fastened",["In the sleeper berth", "Inside the cargo area", "In the glove box under other papers"],"Keep shipping papers in a pouch on the driver's door, or in clear view within immediate reach while the seat belt is fastened.");
