Q(14,10,2,"Table 2 hazard classes (non-bulk) need placards at what total amount?","1,001 pounds or more",["Any amount", "500 pounds", "5,000 pounds"],"Except for bulk packaging, Table 2 hazard classes need placards only if the total amount transported is 1,001 pounds or more, including the package.");
