Q(14,10,2,"What fire extinguisher must the power unit of a placarded vehicle carry?","One with a UL rating of 10 B:C or more",["Any water extinguisher", "A 1 B:C unit", "None is required"],"The power unit of placarded vehicles must have a fire extinguisher with a UL rating of 10 B:C or more.");
F(14,10,"What fire extinguisher must the power unit of a placarded vehicle carry?","One with a UL rating of 10 B:C or more. The power unit of placarded vehicles must have a fire extinguisher with a UL rating of 10 B:C or more.");
