Q(14,10,2,"Someone attending a placarded vehicle away from it must stay how close?","Within 100 feet, with the vehicle in clear view",["Within 1,000 feet", "In the next building", "Anywhere on the property"],"The attendant must be in the vehicle, awake and not in the sleeper berth, or within 100 feet of the vehicle and have it in clear view.");
