Q(14,10,2,"How far from a placarded cargo tank with Class 3 flammable liquids or Division 2.1 gases is smoking forbidden?","Within 25 feet",["Within 5 feet", "Within 100 feet", "Only inside the cab"],"Do not smoke within 25 feet of a placarded cargo tank used for Class 3 (flammable liquids) or Division 2.1 (gases).");
