Q(14,10,2,"When fueling a vehicle that carries hazardous materials, what is required?","Engine off and someone at the nozzle controlling the fuel flow",["Engine running for power", "Nobody near the nozzle", "Hazard flashers only"],"Turn off your engine before fueling. Someone must always be at the nozzle, controlling fuel flow.");
