Q(14,11,1,"When you fan off the air pressure, the low air warning must come on before pressure drops below what?","55 psi, or the level set by the manufacturer",["100 psi", "20 psi", "5 psi"],"Low air warning devices (buzzer, light, flag) should activate before air pressure drops below 55 psi or the level specified by the manufacturer.");
