Q(14,9,2,"What must never be open when you drive a tank vehicle?","Valves or manhole covers",["The driver's window", "The vent on the cab roof", "The tool box"],"Never drive a tank vehicle with open valves or manhole covers.");
F(14,9,"What must never be open when you drive a tank vehicle?","Valves or manhole covers. Never drive a tank vehicle with open valves or manhole covers.");
Q(14,9,2,"What is the legal status of carrying liquids or gases in a leaking tank?","It is a crime; you will be cited and stopped from driving further",["It is allowed for short trips", "It is allowed if you report it later", "It only brings a warning"],"Do not carry liquids or gases in a leaking tank. To do so is a crime; you will be cited and prevented from driving further.");
