Q(14,9,2,"When does a Class C vehicle need a tank endorsement?","When it carries hazardous materials in liquid or gas form in tanks of the rated sizes",["Never", "Whenever it carries any liquid", "Only when towing a trailer"],"A tank endorsement is also required for Class C vehicles when the vehicle is used to transport hazardous materials in liquid or gas form in the rated tanks.");
F(14,9,"When does a Class C vehicle need a tank endorsement?","When it carries hazardous materials in liquid or gas form in tanks of the rated sizes. A tank endorsement is also required for Class C vehicles when the vehicle is used to transport hazardous materials in liquid or gas form in the rated tanks.");
